OL,3,GNEWSAFirst look at The Other Bennet
OL,4,ASister Christmas special revealed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first image from The Other Bennet
OL,7,FSister Christmas special has been
OL,8,Frevealed, teasing a romantic picnic
OL,9,Fscene.
OL,11,FInspired by Jane Austen's Pride and
OL,12,FPrejudice, the first series was filmed
OL,13,Flargely in Wales and attracted 7.3
OL,14,Fmillion UK viewers in its first four
OL,15,Fweeks.
OL,17,FThe series finale saw Mary Bennet,
OL,18,Fplayed by Ella Bruccoleri, agree to
OL,19,Fmarry Tom Hayward, played by Donal
OL,20,FFinn.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
